      "value": "Yes please implement this. Here is a version of the VRCAvatarDescriptorEditor.cs I wrote that includes this viseme auto selection. When you press the auto detect button and there is a mesh containing visemes it gets selected, the lip sync mode gets changed to \"Viseme Blend Shape\" and it fills in all the visemes if they have a certain name.",
